    "scope": "Concrete actual E/F5:y²=x³+3x+2 has actual discriminant nonzero/count5/four nonzero pointorders5. Every characteristic5 field actual nonzero5-torsion point has x1/2,y±1, derived via two actual repeated-S3 doubling identities, kernelchecked finite-field eliminant factor and coprime3/5 group-order control. Every algebraic extension K/F5: actual whole geometric5-torsion point kernel equals actual Point.map image of E(F5); actual bijection/cardinality5 derived, including algebraic closure. Full geometric point-kernel inclusion is true while5 doesnotdivide5^k-1 forallk>0, directly refuting unrestricted inclusion paraphrase despiteprime5/dividingactualbasecount/notdividingq-1. OriginalBK source r²-count criterion bothfalse survives in every actualfiniteextension; source theorem notrefuted. Two prior S3 argumentcores adaptedonlymodule/public wrappers with original mathematical arguments unchanged; originals/rawcopies/amendment retained and credited, existing characteristic3 analog credited. Not nonreducedp-torsion group scheme/generalprime>=5 canonicalWeil/rank/determinant sourceproof/fullpopulationallkcensus/all14 closure. No canonical promotion/novelty.",
